  "title": "Marc Philipp Gemballa’s New Marsien Is an Otherworldly Porsche-Based GT",
  "summary": "Marc Philipp Gemballa is honoring what would have been his father Uwe‘s 70th birthday with a limited run of road-focused versions of his Marsien all-terrain model. Based on a Porsche 911 (992) Turbo S, the new Marsien GT retains the 959-like styling of its predecessor but eschews that car’s complex off-road suspension in favor of […]",
